      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "AS-BUILT 2026-08-03 (run 20260801-171149, A3 fresh-context review response) - integration_definitions:\n(F2) the legacy-runtime boot import is REPORT-ONLY by default - it persists NOTHING unless the operator\nsets EKOA_IMPORT_LEGACY_RUNTIME=1; every boot logs the would-import set (deviation from RUN_SPEC\nassumption 3, decisions.md 2026-08-03). (F1) sentinel-org (__legacy_runtime__) rows stay SUPER-ADMIN-\naddressable at every visibility (isDefinitionVisibleTo carve-out; retired rows resolve LAST and list only\nwhen nothing live holds the key), so retire (global->org) <-> restore (org->global) is exactly reversible\nthrough the E1 setVisibility surface - no more one-way trapdoor. (F3) skillMd has TWO read views:\nresolveSkillMd = scrubbed PROMPT-egress only; resolveSkillMdRaw = byte-exact EDITABLE view (builder\nload/save round-trips raw bytes - a redaction can never be written back). (L4) builder sessions no longer\ncarry loadedKey: reserved keys are refused identically on the chat and save surfaces.",
      "rawText": "AS-BUILT 2026-08-03 (run 20260801-171149, A3 fresh-context review response) - integration_definitions:\n(F2) the legacy-runtime boot import is REPORT-ONLY by default - it persists NOTHING unless the operator\nsets EKOA_IMPORT_LEGACY_RUNTIME=1; every boot logs the would-import set (deviation from RUN_SPEC\nassumption 3, decisions.md 2026-08-03). (F1) sentinel-org (__legacy_runtime__) rows stay SUPER-ADMIN-\naddressable at every visibility (isDefinitionVisibleTo carve-out; retired rows resolve LAST and list only\nwhen nothing live holds the key), so retire (global->org) <-> restore (org->global) is exactly reversible\nthrough the E1 setVisibility surface - no more one-way trapdoor. (F3) skillMd has TWO read views:\nresolveSkillMd = scrubbed PROMPT-egress only; resolveSkillMdRaw = byte-exact EDITABLE view (builder\nload/save round-trips raw bytes - a redaction can never be written back). (L4) builder sessions no longer\ncarry loadedKey: reserved keys are refused identically on the chat and save surfaces.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "AS-BUILT 2026-08-03 (run 20260801-171149, A3 fresh-context review response) - integration_definitions:\n(F2) the legacy-runtime boot import is REPORT-ONLY by default - it persists NOTHING unless the operator\nsets EKOA_IMPORT_LEGACY_RUNTIME=1; every boot logs the would-import set (deviation from RUN_SPEC\nassumption 3, decisions.md 2026-08-03). (F1) sentinel-org (__legacy_runtime__) rows stay SUPER-ADMIN-\naddressable at every visibility (isDefinitionVisibleTo carve-out; retired rows resolve LAST and list only\nwhen nothing live holds the key), so retire (global->org) <-> restore (org->global) is exactly reversible\nthrough the E1 setVisibility surface - no more one-way trapdoor. (F3) skillMd has TWO read views:\nresolveSkillMd = scrubbed PROMPT-egress only; resolveSkillMdRaw = byte-exact EDITABLE view (builder\nload/save round-trips raw bytes - a redaction can never be written back). (L4) builder sessions no longer\ncarry loadedKey: reserved keys are refused identically on the chat and save surfaces.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
